  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Back_items\" title=\"Category:Back items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Back.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mantle_of_the_Worldshaper\">Mantle of the Worldshaper</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #DDAAFF solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#EEDDFF;--bg-color-2-dark:#3A2F45;--header-color:#DDA0DD;--header-color-dark:#773777;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\">5\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Mantle_of_the_Worldshaper_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mantle_of_the_Worldshaper_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"815\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Clothing / Cloak\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Back\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a>:</b> Found only in meteorites and the rarest of veins in magical areas, this ultrahard metal adds to the quality of a weapon or suit of armor. Weapons made of adamantine have the ability to bypass the protective damage reduction of certain monsters.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0002020000</span>2,020<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Abandoned_Excavation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Abandoned Excavation\">The Abandoned Excavation</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heroic_Inspiration\" title=\"Heroic Inspiration\">Heroic Inspiration</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Heroic_Inspiration\" title=\"Heroic Inspiration\">Heroic Inspiration</a>:</b> This item inspires you to acts of great heroism, granting a +5% bonus to <a href=\"/page/Experience_point\" title=\"Experience point\">experience points</a> granted by completing quests while it is equipped. This stacks with experience boosting effects from <a href=\"/page/Item:Experience_Elixir\" title=\"Item:Experience Elixir\">elixirs</a> but does not stack with experience boosting effects from other equippable items.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Regeneration\" title=\"Regeneration\"> Regeneration</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Regeneration\" title=\"Regeneration\"> Regeneration</a>:</b> Causes the wearer to regenerate 1 hit point a minute using positive energy.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Absorption\" title=\"Spell Absorption\">Spell Absorption</a> - 5 Charges (Recharged/Day: 1)<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Absorption\" title=\"Spell Absorption\">Spell Absorption</a>:</b> This effect absorbs harmful spells targeted at the wearer.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Mantle_of_the_Worldshaper.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Mantle_of_the_Worldshaper.png/420px-Mantle_of_the_Worldshaper.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"416\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mantle_of_the_Worldshaper.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Catalyst_Crafting\" title=\"Catalyst Crafting\">Catalyst Crafting</a> to \n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Item:Dream_of_the_Worldshaper\" title=\"Item:Dream of the Worldshaper\">Dream of the Worldshaper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Dream_of_the_Worldshaper\" title=\"Item:Legendary Dream of the Worldshaper\">Legendary Dream of the Worldshaper</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>A comforting and inspiring presence surrounds you as you hold this cloak. Arcane runes run along the edges of this fine cape, and masterfully drawn on the silken lining is an incredibly detailed map of a place named 'Blackmoor'.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li>This item is a tribute to Dave Arneson who narrated the <a href=\"/page/Ruins_of_Threnal\" title=\"Ruins of Threnal\">Ruins of Threnal</a> storyline. Blackmoor was his personal campaign setting, which he originally created for a series of fantasy wargames; the setting was later used as a development environment for the earliest editions of the game.</li>\n<li>You may decide to wear a different cloak throughout a quest, then don this one just before receiving XP at the end of a quest. (Many players do that with <a href=\"/page/Voice_of_the_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Voice of the Master\">Voice of the Master</a>.) When a party is about to fight the final boss or open the last chest, you will often hear a player say \"Voices!\" as a reminder to the group. In party chat, someone might type \"VOM\", or just \"V\", to notify you.</li>\n<li>This is part of the <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#DM&#39;s_Vision\" title=\"Named item sets\">DM's Vision</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#DM&#39;s_Vision\" title=\"Named item sets\">DM's Vision</a></b>: With the two original Dungeon Masters guiding you, you can see through most illusions and trickery. You are under the effects of the <a href=\"/page/True_Seeing\" title=\"True Seeing\">True Seeing</a> spell.</span></span> item set, along with the <a href=\"/page/Voice_of_the_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Voice of the Master\">Voice of the Master</a> from <a href=\"/page/Delera%27s_Tomb\" title=\"Delera&#39;s Tomb\">Delera's Tomb</a> (<a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Voice_of_the_Master\" title=\"Item:Epic Voice of the Master\">its epic version</a> will also work.)</li>\n<li>This can also be used in <a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to make <a href=\"/page/The_Master%27s_Gift\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Master&#39;s Gift\">The Master's Gift</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817222255\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.090 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.137 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2961/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28385/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9342/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n138.02%  155.660     43 Template:IO\n100.00%  112.781      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  112.781      1 -total\n 97.31%  109.742      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 45.75%   51.598      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 44.87%   50.607      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 43.92%   49.537      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 42.64%   48.090      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.02%   24.838      6 Template:Popup\n 17.54%   19.779      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:10106-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817222255 and revision id 700356. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Clothing\n  | name                     = Mantle of the Worldshaper\n  | slot                     = Back\n  | type                     = Cloak\n  | durability               = 100\n  | material                 = Adamantine\n  | hardness                 = 25\n  | basevalue                = 2020 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | minlevel                 = 5\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA|1}}\n  | quest                    = The Abandoned Excavation\n  | end reward               = yes\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Heroic Inspiration}}\n* {{Regeneration}}\n* {{Absorption|spell|0|5|1}}\n  | description              = A comforting and inspiring presence surrounds you as you hold this cloak. Arcane runes run along the edges of this fine cape, and masterfully drawn on the silken lining is an incredibly detailed map of a place named 'Blackmoor'.\n  | pic                      = Mantle of the Worldshaper shown.jpg\n  | picdesc                  = Mantle of the Worldshaper.png\n  | crafting                 = Catalyst Crafting\n  | craftingupgrade          = Dream of the Worldshaper¦Legendary Dream of the Worldshaper\n  | tips                     = \n* This item is a tribute to Dave Arneson who narrated the [[Ruins of Threnal]] storyline. Blackmoor was his personal campaign setting, which he originally created for a series of fantasy wargames; the setting was later used as a development environment for the earliest editions of the game.\n* You may decide to wear a different cloak throughout a quest, then don this one just before receiving XP at the end of a quest. (Many players do that with [[Voice of the Master]].) When a party is about to fight the final boss or open the last chest, you will often hear a player say \"Voices!\" as a reminder to the group. In party chat, someone might type \"VOM\", or just \"V\", to notify you.\n* This is part of the {{DM's Vision}} item set, along with the [[Voice of the Master]] from [[Delera's Tomb]] ([[Item:Epic Voice of the Master|its epic version]] will also work.)\n* This can also be used in [[Epic Crafting]] to make [[The Master's Gift]].\n}}",
